          ],
          "details": "Create a new class org.jsoup.parser.ParserConfigSupport that encapsulates the legacy configuration passthroughs currently on Parser. The new class will hold a reference to the existing ParserConfig and expose the moved operations. The following public methods are removed from Parser and moved to ParserConfigSupport (delegating to ParserConfig): isTrackErrors(), setTrackErrors(int), getErrors(), isTrackPosition(), setTrackPosition(boolean), settings(ParseSettings), settings(), setMaxDepth(int), getMaxDepth(), tagSet(TagSet), tagSet(). Parser is updated to remove these methods and to add a single accessor method public ParserConfigSupport configSupport() { return new ParserConfigSupport(this.config); } so callers can obtain the configuration helper. The moved methods on ParserConfigSupport will return types appropriate for the extracted responsibility (setter chaining returns ParserConfigSupport) and delegate directly to ParserConfig. No other Parser behavior is changed. This concentrates configuration responsibilities into a single class, reducing Parser's public API surface.",
          "risk": "medium"
        },
